TITLE:: GrowlView
summary:: Growl's display
categories:: Libraries>Growl
related:: Classes/Growl, Classes/FxParamView, Classes/FxParamPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What link::Classes/FxParamPanel:: puts at the top of Growl's window. In it, drag a curve up and down for that stage's drive; the wheel on a curve for its bias; drag a matrix cell for how much that source moves that destination; double click a cell to clear it.

It draws from the object's settings and the replies its meters bring, so it is only live while the window is running; link::Classes/FxParamView:: has the rest.

